<Section title="Editorial responsibilities" description="The roles involved in preparing and maintaining Mind Assembly readings.">
  <h2>Contributors</h2>
  <p>Contributors develop a reading, cite their sources and disclose relevant interests.</p>
  <h2>Editors and reviewers</h2>
  <p>Editors check scope, clarity and attribution. Where a reviewer is assigned, they check how the text interprets the primary evidence and describes its limitations. The editor records substantive revisions and handles correction requests.</p>
  <p><a href="/editorial/">Read the editorial standards and corrections process</a></p>
</Section>
